TI  - Trophic shift of soil animal species with forest type as indicated by stable isotope analysis
AU  - Bernhard Klarner
AU  - Roswitha B. Ehnes
AU  - Georgia Erdmann
AU  - Bernhard Eitzinger
AU  - Melanie M. Pollierer
AU  - Mark Maraun
AU  - Stefan Scheu
