TI  - Does the enrichment of post-arable soil with organic matter stimulate forest ecosystem restoration—A view from the perspective of three decades after the afforestation of farmland
AU  - Marek Sławski
AU  - Taida Tarabuła
AU  - Małgorzata Sławska
JO  - Forest Ecology and Management
PY  - 2020
VL  - 478
SP  - 118525
