TI  - Impact of land use history and soil properties on soil mite communities (Acari, Mesostigmata) inhabiting stands growing on post‐agricultural land
AU  - Jacek Malica
AU  - Grzegorz Rączka
AU  - Krzysztof Turczański
AU  - Agnieszka Andrzejewska
AU  - Maciej Skorupski
