TI  - Winter cover crops alter nematode community composition and soil health dynamics in corn-soybean systems
AU  - Jerry Akanwari
AU  - Md. Rashedul Islam
AU  - Ping Liang
AU  - Tahera Sultana
JO  - Applied Soil Ecology
PY  - 2025
VL  - 216
