TI  - Evaluating retention forestry 10 years after its introduction in temperate forests regarding the provision of tree-related microhabitats and dead wood
AU  - Josef Großmann
AU  - L. Carlson
AU  - Gerald Kändler
AU  - Patrick Pyttel
AU  - J. Kleinschmit
AU  - Jürgen Bauhus
JO  - European Journal of Forest Research
PY  - 2023
